675
00:47:29.420 --> 00:47:31.580
Edasi on see,
et meie tuleme ikkagi siia.

676
00:47:31.680 --> 00:47:33.880
Kuigi me teame,
et peaks olema ainult seesamane lend

677
00:47:33.980 --> 00:47:36.300
